	Don't bother.  I've worked in control rooms, where the same
general question arises in showing alarm states for process equipment.
Check for the worst problem status, and that determines the color.

	Worst_Problem = max(Hunger_Status, HP_Status, Food_Pois_Status,
	                    Slime_Status...)

	0 = "No problem here.  Time for coffee."  = green
	1 = "Is this supposed to be leaking oil?" = yellow
	2 = "Gas leak!  Evacuate the area, fast!" = red

	Some problems will never show yellow.  Stoning, for instance.

